[I] Palm pilot desktop software for Linux

[T] J-Pilot is a full-featured desktop organizer application for the Palm
[T] Pilot that runs under Linux and UNIX. It includes support for
[T] datebooks, addresses, memos, todos, expenses, and has plugin support.
[T] It uses the GTK+ libraries.

[U] https://www.jpilot.org/

[A] The jpilot Team
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/office

[L] GPL
[V] 2.1.1

